SCOPE OF THE REQUEST

I request that you:

1. Delete the personal data held in connection with the account identified above, including profile fields, contact details, and any contact or address book data imported from other services;
2. Close or deactivate the account itself;
3. Cease any further processing of that data for advertising, profiling, model training, or disclosure to third parties;
4. Where you have disclosed that data to processors, affiliates, or other recipients, communicate this request to them; and
5. Confirm what has been deleted and identify anything you decline to delete, together with the legal basis on which you retain it.

I acknowledge that you may be required to retain a limited record of this request itself, and specific records where a legal obligation requires it. I ask that any such retention be identified specifically rather than asserted in general terms.

IDENTITY VERIFICATION

I am willing to complete whatever proportionate verification step you require to establish that I control this account. Please tell me what you need. Under no circumstances should this request be refused for lack of verification without first telling me what verification would satisfy you.

RESPONSE REQUESTED

Please confirm in writing within {{ response_window_days }} days which of the above actions you have taken.

